ach season reshapes the land and alters how the game plays. A level that feels manageable in spring may become far more dangerous when faced in autumn or winter, as resources grow scarce and enemies become more aggressive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can return to the same locations under different seasonal conditions, changing the difficulty and forcing new strategies. What thrives in one season may struggle in the next, encouraging experimentation, adaptation, and replayability with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255590/extras/4195c585a35cbfef821ceb3e6ae89242.poster.avif?t=1787728331\" width=1170 height=646 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255590/extras/4195c585a35cbfef821ceb3e6ae89242.webm?t=1787728331\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255590/extras/4195c585a35cbfef821ceb3e6ae89242.mp4?t=1787728331\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255590/extras/e8993aebfd7d4911299324cc90180781.webp?t=1787728331\" width=621 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 handcrafted levels across 4 seasons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escalating difficulty and strategic choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique Guardians with distinct playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 enemy types that evolve over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 powerful nature abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG-style progression and upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Forest Calls for Aid</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you answer...<br>or let it burn?</p>", "short_description": "In this Dark-Fantasy, RTS game, you play the role of a Forest Deity protecting your Grove against an onslaught of loggers, warriors and poachers. Use your powers to grow trees, summon guardians, set traps, and employ magic to defend, and eventually conquer your human oppressors.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“A tactical game of population-limit balancing and resource management that knows exactly why launching enemies into the sky is fun.”<br>PC Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255590/e789eaf4cfc4eea9182142e81f8ae07674866457/header.jpg?t=1787728331", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255590/295485ecf9d6b6512f862f93a056b298443a9a93/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787728331", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3255590/295485ecf9d6b6512f862f93a056b298443a9a93/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787728331", "website": "https://steepsummitstudios.com/grove-keeper", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 20XX or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 30XX or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Steep Summit Studios"], "publishers": ["Steep Summit Studios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": tru